description	"The Soldier

Based on open mode's soldier class, but given the full set of weapons and double the reinforcements.

^2Weaponry:
- Blaster Pistol (2)
- Blaster Rifle (3)
- E-22 Reciprocating Blaster (3)
- 2 Concussion Grenades
- 1 Frag Grenade

^8Attributes:
- 5 Reinforcements (CTF: 4s respawn)
- Assemble (1)

^2Strengths^7: Swarm tactics and overwhelming numbers.
^1Weaknesses^7: Inferior individual troop quality."